                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg88">p. 88</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d242-f2" n="22" xml:id="d242-f2-content">
                <p>See last paragraph of telegram dated September 26, from the Commission of
                    Neutrals to the Paraguayan Minister for Foreign Affairs, <ref target="#pg96">p.
